" class=\"css-nm7ja6 e1yv2nyc2\" alt=\"Image for State of Code Developer Survey report: The current reality of AI coding\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><style data-emotion=\"css o76qu6\">.css-o76qu6{padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-top:32px;padding-bottom:32px;-webkit-flex:1 1 0%;-ms-flex:1 1 0%;flex:1 1 0%;display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-flex-direction:column;-ms-flex-direction:column;flex-direction:column;text-align:left;}</style><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><style data-emotion=\"css 4tlw9v\">.css-4tlw9v{font-family:Inter,Inter-Fallback;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:16px;line-height:17px;letter-spacing:2.4px;display:block;margin-bottom:16px;}</style><span class=\"css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><style data-emotion=\"css fjv57c\">.css-fjv57c{font-family:Poppins,Poppins-Fallback;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#290042;display:block;margin-bottom:16px;}.css-fjv57c .ais-Highlight-highlighted{--tw-bg-opacity:1;background-color:rgb(211 18 29 / var(--tw-bg-opacity, 1));color:#FFFFFF;}</style><h3 class=\"css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc6\">State of Code Developer Survey report: The current reality of AI coding</h3><style data-emotion=\"css vunwgt\">.css-vunwgt{font-family:Inter,Inter-Fallback;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;color:#290042;margin-bottom:24px;}@media (min-width: 720px){.css-vunwgt{margin-bottom:32px;}}.css-vunwgt .ais-Highlight-highlighted{--tw-bg-opacity:1;background-color:rgb(211 18 29 / var(--tw-bg-opacity, 1));color:#FFFFFF;}.not-clickable .css-vunwgt{margin-bottom:0;}</style><p class=\"css-vunwgt e1yv2nyc5\">What we found challenges the common narrative. While AI adoption is massive, it hasn’t led to a simple, linear boost in productivity. Instead, it has shifted the bottleneck from writing code to verifying it.</p><style data-emotion=\"css 18j4al9\">.css-18j4al9{font-family:Inter,Inter-Fallback;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:17px;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#126ED3;margin-top:auto;}.not-clickable .css-18j4al9{display:none;}</style><p class=\"css-18j4al9 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/state-of-code-developer-survey-report-the-current-reality-of-ai-coding/","retrieved":1767884049821},{"title":"Zombie Workflows: A GitHub Actions horror story","contents":"<picture><source media=\"(min-width: 1120px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"352\" height=\"217\"><source media=\"(min-width: 720px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"720\" height=\"443\"><source srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"><img src=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/9ad540eb-14e0-4e2f-a87c-600247b222ba/content_734_zombie_workflows_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70\" class=\"css-nm7ja6 e1yv2nyc2\" alt=\"Image for Zombie Workflows: A GitHub Actions horror story\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><span class=\"css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><h3 class=\"css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc6\">Zombie Workflows: A GitHub Actions horror story</h3><p class=\"css-vunwgt e1yv2nyc5\">Our research team recently discovered an exploitable pattern in GitHub Actions that lets attackers exploit seemingly fixed vulnerabilities.</p><p class=\"css-18j4al9 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/zombie-workflows-a-github-actions-horror-story/","retrieved":1765880122004},{"title":"The Cloudflare outage and why code quality matters more than ever","contents":"<picture><source media=\"(min-width: 1120px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"352\" height=\"217\"><source media=\"(min-width: 720px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"720\" height=\"443\"><source srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"><img src=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/29a23656-e2bf-4d7c-8ff8-e9699a46f3bb/cloudflare_outage_hero_image_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70\" class=\"css-nm7ja6 e1yv2nyc2\" alt=\"Image for The Cloudflare outage and why code quality matters more than ever\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><span class=\"css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><h3 class=\"css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc6\">The Cloudflare outage and why code quality matters more than ever</h3><p class=\"css-vunwgt e1yv2nyc5\">This blog post looks at how seemingly small decisions can have massive effects, and the importance of prioritizing code quality to build reliable software.</p><p class=\"css-18j4al9 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/the-cloudflare-outage-and-why-code-quality-matters-more-than-ever/","retrieved":1765880122006},{"title":"Why prioritizing code quality is the fastest way to reduce security risks","contents":"<picture><source media=\"(min-width: 1120px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"352\" height=\"217\"><source media=\"(min-width: 720px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"720\" height=\"443\"><source srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"><img src=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/53fb6dd6-5c86-41da-9e04-0c9b450af211/content_527_code_quality_security_blog_index_2x.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70\" class=\"css-nm7ja6 e1yv2nyc2\" alt=\"Image for Why prioritizing code quality is the fastest way to reduce&nbsp;security risks\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><span class=\"css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><h3 class=\"css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc6\">Why prioritizing code quality is the fastest way to reduce&nbsp;security risks</h3><p class=\"css-vunwgt e1yv2nyc5\">The common perception is that a security vulnerability is a rare, complex attack pattern. In reality, the journey of most flaws begins much earlier and much more simply: as a&nbsp;code quality&nbsp;issue. For both developers and security practitioners, understanding this lifecycle is crucial to building secure, reliable, and maintainable software. </p><p class=\"css-18j4al9 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/why-prioritizing-code-quality-is-the-fastest-way-to-reduce-security-risks/","retrieved":1765880122008}]}